    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>LabelRejectionOfPaymentForDimensionalGoods</name>
      <id>260</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>&lt;img 0:188d8f0e-94da-44bb-8ed3-21aa01e973b9/> As measured goods shipment is exceeded within the allowable deviation, the prepayment amount can be exceeded by </value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>&lt;img 0:188d8f0e-94da-44bb-8ed3-21aa01e973b9/> از آنجا که ارسال کالاهای اندازه‌گیری‌شده در حد انحراف مجاز فراتر رفته است، مبلغ پیش‌پرداخت می‌تواند فراتر رود به میزان</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>&lt;img 0:188d8f0e-94da-44bb-8ed3-21aa01e973b9/> Вследствие превышения отгрузки мерных товаров в пределах допустимых отклонений cумма предоплаты может быть превышена на </value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Boyutlu ürünlerin sevkiyatının izin verilen sapmalar içindeki fazlalığı nedeniyle, peşinat tutarının aşılabileceği tutar</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>&lt;img 0:188d8f0e-94da-44bb-8ed3-21aa01e973b9/>Do vượt quá lô hàng hàng hóa đo được trong phạm vi dung sai, số tiền trả trước có thể vượt quá</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>&lt;img 0:188d8f0e-94da-44bb-8ed3-21aa01e973b9/> As measured goods shipment is exceeded within the allowable deviation, the prepayment amount can be exceeded by </value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>&lt;img 0:188d8f0e-94da-44bb-8ed3-21aa01e973b9/> As measured goods shipment is exceeded within the allowable deviation, the prepayment amount can be exceeded by </value>
      </title>
